close_reason: "Merged in #110 (fc4c11f). Explicit --todotxt-mapping fidelity on import, export and sync keeps +project vs @context, spelling, duplicates, token order, source dates, key:value tokens and A-Z priorities; the default mapping is unchanged. Review found a pre-existing data-loss path: rows sharing a title signature or resolving to one item collapsed into one exported row; the upsert preflight now refuses ambiguous signatures and shared targets before any write. Committed evidence: the fidelity test's generator round-trips 312/312 cases (test/todotxt-fidelity.test.ts), preflight and target-check tests fail on behavioural revert, npm+Bun release:check pass, and CodeRabbit's full review at 43998fb had no actionable comments. Additional out-of-tree orchestrator checks (scripts not committed): 2000/2000 independently generated lines round-tripped exactly in fidelity mode, and default-mode output matched main byte-for-byte on the same lines."
body: ""
